  'Ayer estuve en el médico. Dice que debo quedarme una semana en casa y beber mucho té. Mi mujer pregunta: «¿Te traigo algo de la farmacia?».': 'I was at the doctor\'s yesterday. He says I should stay at home for a week and drink plenty of tea. My wife asks: "Shall I get you something from the chemist\'s?"',
